                                "sense_id": "0c2489da-8dfb-37c6-90b3-5ccd5efdcab3",
                                "text": "This is an appeal from an order of the Orphans' Court of Frederick County requiring the appellant, the surviving executor of John Sifford, deceased, to give countersecurity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37b762d2-809a-42d6-9e96-f50eaa6767c3",
                                "sense_id": "0c2489da-8dfb-37c6-90b3-5ccd5efdcab3",
                                "text": "Sir John's executors, under colour of some countersecurities given to Sir John and some assignments of judgments, unjustly compelled Sir Arthur to pay 1,600l. and upwards for debts from which Sir John had discharged him."
